{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PjKGak7zaBmE6DypNE1ZeS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# W371 check digits\n2\t\n3\tAn identifier is a string of digits followed by one check digit.\n4\t\n5\t- Weights cycle 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, ... assigned to the payload digits from\n6\t  RIGHT to LEFT (the rightmost payload digit has weight 3).\n7\t- The weighted sum S is the sum of digit x weight over the payload.\n8\t- The check digit is (10 - (S mod 10)) mod 10.\n9\t- An identifier is VALID when its last digit equals the check digit of\n10\t  the payload before it.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"413669a4-350e-468f-ad36-c774aadeb1eb","uuid":"7caa54a4-97a0-4c00-ba4d-b6e337421478","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:35:10.215Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t06/shadow/exec-ws/package/artifacts/spec.md","content":"# W371 check digits\n\nAn identifier is a string of digits followed by one check digit.\n\n- Weights cycle 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, ... assigned to the payload digits from\n  RIGHT to LEFT (the rightmost payload digit has weight 3).\n- The weighted sum S is the sum of digit x weight over the payload.\n- The check digit is (10 - (S mod 10)) mod 10.\n- An identifier is VALID when its last digit equals the check digit of\n  the payload before it.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
